{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2033","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Kosuke's Sloth"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Kosuke is too lazy. He will not give you any legend, just the task:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Fibonacci numbers are defined as follows:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1)=f(2)=1$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(n)=f(n-1)+f(n-2)$$$ $$$(3\\le n)$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"kind":"text","text":" We denote $$$G(n,k)$$$ as an index of the $$$n$$$-th Fibonacci number that is divisible by $$$k$$$. For given $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$, compute $$$G(n,k)$$$."},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"As this number can be too big, output it by modulo $$$10^9+7$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example: $$$G(3,2)=9$$$ because the $$$3$$$-rd Fibonacci number that is divisible by $$$2$$$ is $$$34$$$. $$$[1,1,\\textbf{2},3,5,\\textbf{8},13,21,\\textbf{34}]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input data contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first and only line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^{18}$$$, $$$1 \\le k \\le 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$k$$$ across all test cases does not exceed $$$10^6$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output the only number: the value $$$G(n,k)$$$ taken by modulo $$$10^9+7$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n3 2\n100 1\n1000000000000 1377\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n9\n100\n999244007\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"2033F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2033/problem/F"}